[{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0306","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0306.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-5076","title":"Oracle Java SE JAX-WS 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle Java SE 的 Java 运行时环境（JRE）组件中的 JAX-WS 存在未指定的安全漏洞，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页或运行特制的 Java Applet 触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标系统上实现远程代码执行，完全控制受影响的系统，导致机密性、完整性和可用性丧失。该漏洞影响 Oracle Java SE 7 Update 7 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。Metasploit 框架已集成该漏洞的利用模块，攻击门槛较低，且已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），需尽快修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-5076"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-10-16T21:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:46:10Z","remediation":"立即升级 Oracle Java SE 至 7 Update 9（7u9）或更高版本，该版本已修复 JAX-WS 组件的远程代码执行漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器中禁用 Java Applet 执行（通过 Java 控制面板取消勾选\"启用 Java 内容\"），或在 Web 服务器层面过滤对 JAX-WS 端点的外部访问请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-10/msg00016.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1386.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1391.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1467.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/51029","http://secunia.com/advisories/51326","http://secunia.com/advisories/51390","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201406-32.xml","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/javacpuoct2012-1515924.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16641","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-5076","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22657","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-5076.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2012/5xxx/CVE-2012-5076.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-5076","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2012/5xxx/CVE-2012-5076.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2012/CVE-2012-5076/README_KO.md","https://github.com/killvxk/thg-framework/blob/fab929cd77c91373ebc4212bd4e5891b54f0fb1b/data/source/exploits/cve-2012-5076/Makefile","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/20214.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2012-5076.html","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-5076.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0306.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2012/EXP-AVE-2012-0306.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0306.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0025","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-5321","title":"Tiki Wiki CMS Groupware URL 重定向漏洞","description":"Tiki Wiki CMS Groupware 8.3 版本的 tiki-featured_link.php 文件中存在 URL 重定向漏洞。攻击者可通过向 url 参数传入恶意构造的链接，诱导用户点击后加载任意外部网页到框架中，实施钓鱼攻击。该漏洞源于程序对用户输入的 url 参数缺乏充分验证与过滤（CWE-20），属于开放重定向类型。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响 Tiki Wiki CMS Groupware 8.3 及可能更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.8，危害等级中危。建议升级至最新版本或对 url 参数进行严格的白名单校验。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-5321"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-10-08T18:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:46:39Z","remediation":"升级 Tiki Wiki CMS Groupware 至 9.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 url 参数未正确校验重定向目标的问题。如无法升级，在 tiki-featured_link.php 中对 url 参数添加白名单校验，仅允许内部可信域名，同时设置 X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN 响应头防止点击劫持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/79409","http://secunia.com/advisories/48102","http://st2tea.blogspot.com/2012/02/tiki-wiki-cms-groupware-frame-injection.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52079","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026708","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/73403","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36848","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-5321.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-5321.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2012/CVE-2012-5321.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-5321.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2012/CVE-2012-5321.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2012-5321_9.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2012/5xxx/CVE-2012-5321.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/c911d60f6d680a69991ad0dd5e13c4da403965fe/plugins/tiki/tikiwiki_cms-groupware/CVE-2012-5321.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2012-5321_2.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2012-5321_4.yaml","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--378d067c-14e0-4d52-8639-8fe1d3d696b6.owl","https://github.com/Cappricio-Securities/CVE-2012-5321"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0025.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0263","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0263.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3430","title":"Linux Kernel RDS 套接字本地信息泄露漏洞","description":"Linux内核中net/rds/recv.c文件内的rds_recvmsg函数在3.0.44版本之前未正确初始化某个结构体成员。本地低权限攻击者可通过在RDS（Reliable Datagram Sockets）套接字上发起recvfrom或recvmsg系统调用来触发该漏洞，从而读取内核栈内存中的残留敏感数据，造成本地信息泄露。该漏洞影响Linux内核2.6.x至3.0.43版本，攻击者需具有本地访问权限才能利用。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3430"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-10-03T11:02:56Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:12Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 3.0.44 或更高版本，以修复 net/rds/recv.c 中 rds_recvmsg() 函数未正确初始化 msg_namelen 导致的本地信息泄露漏洞。主流发行版用户应安装各自安全公告中的修复内核：Debian Squeeze 升级至 2.6.32-36，Ubuntu 12.04 升级至 3.2.0-31.50 或 3.0.0-26.42，Red Hat/CentOS 应用对应 RHSA 公告。如暂无法升级，可临时卸载 RDS 内核模块（执行 rmmod rds 或向 /etc/modprobe.d/disable-rds.conf 写入 blacklist rds），并重启系统使配置生效，以阻止本地用户通过 recvfrom/recvmsg 系统调用读取内核栈内存。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://git.kernel.org/?p=linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux-2.6.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=06b6a1cf6e776426766298d055bb3991957d90a7","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1323.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/50633","http://secunia.com/advisories/50732","http://secunia.com/advisories/50811","http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/ChangeLog-3.0.44","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/07/26/5","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1567-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1568-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1572-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1575-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1577-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1578-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1579-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1580-1","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=820039","https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/06b6a1cf6e776426766298d055bb3991957d90a7","https://www.suse.com/support/update/announcement/2012/suse-su-20121679-1.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37543","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2012/CVE-2012-3430.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3430.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3430","https://github.com/fullwaywang/QlRules/blob/241853bffb1f550aca9b1eba7b1c65f00f09ae18/linux/net/CVE-2012-3430_06b6a1c/rds_recvmsg-autogen.ql","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-3430.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3430.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2012/CVE-2012-3430.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5d343bea8cfc0d9952499ddc0950571762ca42cd/2012/CVE-2012-3430.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3430.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7ed81620937dbbe588ba076b06c9b1f7307f7b38/vex/cve/2012/CVE-2012-3430.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0263.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0016","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-4242","title":"WordPress MF Gig Calendar 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"MF Gig Calendar WordPress 插件 0.9.2 版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。攻击者无需认证即可通过向日历页面的查询字符串中注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，当管理员或其他用户访问被篡改的页面时，恶意脚本将在浏览器中执行，可能导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞影响 WordPress MF Gig Calendar 0.9.2 版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-4242"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-10-01T23:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:44:41Z","remediation":"立即升级 MF Gig Calendar 插件至 1.2.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复查询字符串未正确转义导致的 XSS 问题。由于该插件已于 2024 年 3 月从 WordPress 官方仓库下架，建议停用并删除该插件，改用仍在维护的替代插件（如 The Events Calendar）。临时缓解措施可在 WAF 层面添加规则过滤查询字符串中的 `<script>` 等恶意标签。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.reactionpenetrationtesting.co.uk/mf-gig-calendar-xss.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55622","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37829","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4242.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2012/CVE-2012-4242.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/0c7acbe01d12e3db33eedacb7a2c97c0d518fac0/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4242.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2012/4xxx/CVE-2012-4242.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2012-4242_32.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2012/CVE-2012-4242.rules","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE%20List/2012/4xxx/CVE-2012-4242.json","https://github.com/amad3us47/amad3us47.github.io/blob/14d36cd646300e9b9b8fa1a2222524533239a69b/data/cve-2012-4242-2188.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2012-4242-ad8105428e239327d370c7e6d993aab5_2.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/c911d60f6d680a69991ad0dd5e13c4da403965fe/plugins/mf_gig_calendar_project/mf_gig_calendar/CVE-2012-4242.yaml","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_dedup/blob/35ff6751d9dde6c89382c34106bf8165b6ade361/data_out/CVE_similarity/CVE/CVE-2016-4833.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0261","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0261.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2889","title":"Google Chrome 帧处理通用跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 22.0.1229.79 之前版本中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过包含恶意 frame 元素的向量注入任意 Web 脚本或 HTML，实现通用跨站脚本攻击（UXSS）。该漏洞源于浏览器对跨源 frame 的源追踪机制不完善，导致攻击者可在任意站点上下文中执行脚本，窃取用户数据或发起进一步攻击。攻击者需诱使用户访问恶意构造的页面，无需额外权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2889"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-09-26T10:56:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:42:17Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 22.0.1229.79 及以上版本，Chrome 浏览器会自动检查并安装更新，用户也可通过地址栏输入 chrome://settings/help 手动触发更新检查。使用 Apple Safari 的用户应升级至 6.0.3 及以上版本。使用 Apple iOS 设备的用户应安装 Apple 2013 年 1 月发布的安全更新。Linux 发行版用户（如 openSUSE）可安装对应的安全补丁包。由于该漏洞通过帧处理实现跨站脚本攻击，无法立即升级时可在服务端配置 Content-Security-Policy 头部的 frame-src 指令限制可加载的帧来源作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/09/stable-channel-update_25.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2013/Jan/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2013/Mar/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-10/msg00012.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5642","https://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=143439","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/78823","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15829","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2012/CVE-2012-2889.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b2099d0f1ceb94625ab1ba6dca5a48307538ab8/cves/2012/2xxx/CVE-2012-2889.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2889","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-2889","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-2889","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-2889.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf