漏洞","description":"Horde Groupware 的 FTP 服务器曾被入侵，攻击者在官方发布的 Horde 3.3.12 版本中植入了后门代码（下载时间介于 2011 年 11 月 15 日至 2012 年 2 月 7 日之间）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响的 Horde 应用发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该后门，从而在目标服务器上执行任意 PHP 代码，实现完全控制。该漏洞影响范围广，危害严重，Metasploit 框架已提供对应的利用模块。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0209"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-09-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2012-09-26T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即停止使用从官方 FTP 下载的 Horde 3.3.12、Horde Groupware 1.2.10 及 Horde Groupware Webmail Edition 1.2.10（2011年11月至2012年2月期间下载的版本），升级至 Horde 3.3.13、Horde Groupware 1.2.11 或 Horde Groupware Webmail Edition 1.2.11 及以上版本。Horde 4 系列不受影响，无需操作。升级前检查 Horde 目录中是否存在 `$m[1]($m[2])` 后门特征码，如发现则立即隔离服务器并重新安装。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18492","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2012/CVE-2012-0209.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0209.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-0209.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2012/CVE-2012-0209.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0209.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0209.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0209","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0209.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-02xx/CVE-2012-0209.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-0209"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0028.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2012/EXP-AVE-2012-0028.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0028.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0300","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-5054","title":"Adobe Flash Player Matrix3D类整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 11.4.402.265 之前版本中的 Matrix3D 类的 copyRawDataTo 方法存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190）。远程攻击者可通过向受影响的 Flash Player 环境提交特制的畸形参数触发该漏洞，导致内存破坏，进而实现任意代码执行。攻击者通常利用恶意构造的 SWF 文件诱导用户访问，在用户交互条件下完成利用。该漏洞影响 Adobe Flash Player 全平台版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Adobe 已在 11.4.402.265 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-5054"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-09-24T17:55:07Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:46:05Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 11.4.402.265 或更高版本。由于 Adobe Flash Player 已于 2020 年底停止支持并终止分发，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并移除浏览器插件，同时禁用浏览器中所有与 Flash 相关的加载项，以彻底消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/116435/Adobe-Flash-Player-Matrix3D-Integer-Overflow-Code-Execution.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb12-19.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/services/ba-index.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/78866","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-5054","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-5054.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2012/5xxx/CVE-2012-5054.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-5054","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2012/5xxx/CVE-2012-5054.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerabilit