3:43:39Z","remediation":"建议将 Apple iTunes 升级至 10.7 或更高版本以修复该漏洞，可通过 iTunes 的\"检查更新\"功能或直接从 Apple 官网下载最新版本安装。对于 Windows 用户，建议同时安装 Apple Software Update 以确保所有 Apple 组件均获得安全更新。如暂时无法升级，应避免使用 iTunes 访问不受信任的网站内容，并配置防火墙限制 iTunes 对恶意站点的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00005.html","http://osvdb.org/85402","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5502","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55534","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/78555","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A17246","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3648.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3648","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/1e75dd3ffcea184c6cc8eea8f56382ebd42e1f71/osv/cve/2012/UBUNTU-CVE-2012-3648.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/1e75dd3ffcea184c6cc8eea8f56382ebd42e1f71/vex/cve/2012/CVE-2012-3648.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-3648","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-3648","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf61225fd7563/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-3648","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3648.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3648.json","https://github.com/esl