upport.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5502","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55534","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/78546","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A17530","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3643.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3643","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b31a8b82a1e35acc79fb8e5378e5129c94325e4e/osv/cve/2012/UBUNTU-CVE-2012-3643.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b31a8b82a1e35acc79fb8e5378e5129c94325e4e/vex/cve/2012/CVE-2012-3643.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-3643","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-3643","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf61225fd7563/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-3643","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3643.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3643.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-3643"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0320.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0309","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3632","title":"Apple iOS WebKit 内存破坏漏洞","description":"WebKit 是 Apple iOS 和 Safari 浏览器中的网页渲染引擎，该引擎被披露存在内存破坏漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造包含恶意代码的网页，当用户使用受影响版本的 Safari 浏览器访问该网页时，将触发 WebKit 内存损坏问题，导致应用程序崩溃或远程执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Apple iOS 6.0 及更早版本、Safari 6.0.1 及更早版本以及 iTunes 10.7 之前版本。攻击成功需满足的条件是用户主动访问攻击者控制的恶意网站，攻击者可通过网络钓鱼、邮件链接或注入脚本等方式诱导用户点击恶意网页，进而实施代码执行或拒绝服务攻击。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3632"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-09-13T10:30:19Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:37Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple iOS 升级至 6.0.1 或更高版本，同时将 Safari 浏览器升级至 6.0.1 及以上版本、iTunes 升级至 10.7 或更高版本，以修复 WebKit 内存破坏漏洞。对于暂无法升级的设备，应通过配置防火墙或内容过滤网关拦截恶意网站访问，避免访问不可信的网页链接，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00005.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2013/Jan/msg00000.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5502","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5642","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55534","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/78540","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16768","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3632.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3632","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b31a8b82a1e35acc79fb8e5378e5129c94325e4e/osv/cve/2012/UBUNTU-CVE-2012-3632.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b31a8b82a1e35acc79fb8e5378e5129c94325e4e/vex/cve/2012/CVE-2012-3632.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-3632","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-3632","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf61225fd7563/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-3632","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/C